    <string name="help_title">How to enable the service</string>
    <string name="help_text">1. Open Accessibility on the TV.\n2. If the service list is empty, enable it from a computer:\n\nadb shell settings put secure enabled_accessibility_services “%1$s”\nadb shell settings put secure accessibility_enabled 1\n\nRollback: remove the service from that line or uninstall the app.</string>

